        {"zh": "咔嚓！我的牙齿很锋利！", "en": "Crash! My teeth are sharp!"},
        {"zh": "我咬住你的靴跟，往后拽。", "en": "I bite your boot heel and pull backward."},
        {"zh": "吱吱吱，来咬你！", "en": "Squeak, I'm biting you!"},
        {"zh": "快点！我追你！", "en": "Hurry! I'm chasing you!"},
        {"zh": "咔咔咔，我的颚很强壮！", "en": "Click, my jaws are strong!"},
        {"zh": "库卡身边的小鬼，先咬为敬。", "en": "Cuca's little imp — I bite first."},
        {"zh": "呱呱呱，你逃不掉！", "en": "呱呱呱, You can't escape!"},
        {"zh": "我的爪子在你袖子上勾出丝。", "en": "My claws snag threads from your sleeve."},
        {"zh": "吱吱吱，我的牙齿要咬你！", "en": "Squeak, my teeth will bite you!"},
        {"zh": "咕噜，咬住你的袖子！", "en": "Gulu, I've got your sleeve!"},
        {"zh": "咔嚓，我的牙很好！", "en": "Kacha, my teeth are fine!"},
        {"zh": "我用脑袋撞你！", "en": "I butt you with my head!"},
        {"zh": "咕噜噜，抓到了！", "en": "Gururu, got you!"},
        {"zh": "你腿上留个印！", "en": "I'll leave a mark on your leg!"},
        {"zh": "我跳起来挠你脸！", "en": "I jump up and rake your face!"},
        {"zh": "咕噜，别喊疼！", "en": "Gulu, don't cry about it!"},
        {"zh": "这一口是库卡教的！", "en": "Cuca taught me this bite!"},
        {"zh": "我拽住你不放！", "en": "I hold on and don't let go!"},
        {"zh": "咕噜噜，血是甜的！", "en": "Gururu, blood tastes sweet!"}
      ]
    },
